1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Understand PCB engineering intent
Turn natural language into constraints

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Import, instruct, and stream the analysis
Output targets, rules, and priorities

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Read components, nets, and copper layers
Build board-level context

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The shortest path crosses a plane split
Detours add length and vias. Which has priority?

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The board and instruction are ready
Run is now unlocked

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Classify intent and extract targets
Compile constraints and decide priority

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:52,000
PCIE_RX1 has a constraint conflict
Preserve integrity and return continuity

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Evidence highlights targets and risks
It is not an actual routed result

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Natural language becomes
reviewable, structured intent
